    title: 'What does it cost to manufacture a t-shirt? A cost breakdown for brands',
    description:
      'Where your per-shirt cost actually comes from — fabric, cutting, sewing, trims, finishing, and how duty affects your true landed cost when sourcing from Nepal.',
